        {
          "id": 2696997915,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Hah!  I searched all the `CMakeLists` for `m` as a word, `math`, `libm`, `lm`, `MATH_LIBRARIES`, and a bunch of other stuff, but I did not search for `M_LIBRARIES`, and did not search for `m` as a word in `cmake/modules`.  I appear to have done a neat tap-dance all the way around the solution without bumping into it...\n\nThanks for pointing me in the right direction!",
