          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yeah, looking for references to \"m\"/\"M\" without getting tons of false positives is a bit hard, although perhaps not as hard as \"e\"/\"E\" or \"t\"/\"T\". :-)\n\nWe (the Wireshark developers) should probably document CMake idioms such as this in the Developer's Guide.",
