      "title": "wsutil: Fix format_units with FORMAT_SIZE_PREFIX_IEC.",
      "message": "wsutil: Fix format_units with FORMAT_SIZE_PREFIX_IEC.\n\nSet pfx_off to zero if we're using IEC prefixes -- there are no IEC prefixes\nfor fractional values.  Without this, the wrong prefixes are used.\n\nAdd test coverage; The test would fail without the fix included in this commit.\n",
      "author_name": "Darius Davis",
      "author_email": "darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au",
      "authored_date": "2025-08-20T08:13:39.000+10:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
